<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361630" n="1"/>
  <opener><lb/>Illustrissimo atque Celeberrimo Viro
      <lb/><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-102552517">Nicolao Bernoullio</rs> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119166895">Petrus Antonius
      <lb/>Michelottus</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></opener>
  <p><lb/>Meam <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_M3G2JA79">de Separatione Fluidor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> in Corpo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>re Animali Dissertationem</rs> una cum
      <lb/>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stantissimis Doctissimi Tui <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118509969">Patrui</rs> qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/><rs type="biblio" key="biblio_JAFFCHKU">de Motu Musculorum</rs>, ac <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_W6BHQDM2">de Effervescentia
      <lb/>et Fermentatione</rs> inscribuntur Disser<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tationibus jam esse editam, Te, Vir Ami<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cissime, certiorem faciam, Tibique
      <lb/>significo, me heri misisse ad ipsum
      <lb/>Celeberr.<hi rend="sup"><choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></hi> Tu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118509969">Patru<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> duo illarum
      <lb/>ipsarum (uti et me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>) <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_M3G2JA79">Dissertation<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/>exemplaria, quor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> un<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> illi, alter<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>Tibi in perpetu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> erga Te obser<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>vanti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sign<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> dono. Rogavi Illustrissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mam Marchionem <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1221330748">Butintrochi</rs> ut <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-3173435">Me<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>diolano</rs> per <rs type="person">mercatores</rs>, vel alia ratione
      <lb/>sine sumptibus, illa ipsa exemplaria tela
      <lb/>obvoluta ad vos transmittat. Quare
      <lb/>spero brevi ad vos perventura. Id aut<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>
<pb facs="1361632" n="2"/>
      <lb/>statim ac eveniet ut mihi indices etiam
      <lb/>atque etiam rogo. Si vestri <rs type="person">Mercatores</rs>
      <lb/>vellent emere aliquot me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_M3G2JA79">Dissertationis</rs>
      <lb/>(qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> simul cum <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118509969">Bernoullianis</rs> venduntur)
      <lb/><del>poterunt scrib</del>exemplaria, poterunt
      <lb/>scribere ad <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1037587715"><abbr>Jo.</abbr> Gabriell<subst><del><choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></del><add>i</add></subst> Hertz</rs>: hic enim
      <lb/>meo nomine vendit ipsa exemplaria
      <lb/>pretio quindecim pondo.</p> <closer>Vale Vir Ami<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cissime, et fave. <dateline>Dab<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs type="place" key="place_VER-repven">Venetiis</rs> <date when="1721-04-25"><choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>a dato</expan></choice> <date when="1721-04-25">25
      <lb/>Aprilis 1721</date>.</date></dateline></closer>
</div>
